=== 1. HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Enum\HID 下与 VID_2717 / PID_32B8 匹配的实例 ===
HID 类下顶层子键数: 21
匹配 VID+PID 的顶层键: ['{00001812-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb}_Dev_VID&012717_PID&32b8_REV&00a4_<BT-ADDR>']

顶层键 {00001812-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb}_Dev_VID&012717_PID&32b8_REV&00a4_<BT-ADDR> -> 1 个实例
  实例: 9&1748ac9e&0&0000
    Service     = kbdhid
    ClassGUID   = {4d36e96b-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}
    Driver      = {4d36e96b-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\0004
    Mfg         = @keyboard.inf,%std-keyboards%;(Standard keyboards)
    DeviceDesc  = @keyboard.inf,%hid.keyboarddevice%;HID Keyboard Device

